// A Decimal added to a number with '+=' is refused (DEC_TO_DBL makes it
// one); DEC_TO_DBL's value is a number, and so is refused where it meets a
// Decimal, as is a Numeric exponent of a Decimal.
user function f(fA as Decimal, nQ as Numeric)
  nQ += fA
  fA := fA + DEC_TO_DBL(fA)
  fA := fA ** nQ
return nQ
